  "details": "hi! i would just like to propose that the mipmap streaming feature be toggleable for those who dont want to sacrifice quality for slightly better performance. any amount of optimization is good but i want to have the option to choose when and how i control my resources, like if I'm just sitting alone in a slightly heavy world i would rather my avatar not be blurred. the options to choose when and how this feature is used would make it significantly more appealing, similar to existing avatar culling features.",
